{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Test Metrics Programs Failing?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about test metrics programs."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe ways of solving problems and getting things done in written and spoken situations and in work and social contexts. Train the system users on application structuring and management, according to the established plan and user profile, according to the organization policies."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.  Recognizes simple ideas on managing a proposed application, using available hardware for an application, and technical reports on an IT solution."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n8le01ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Passive of present continuous"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use the <span class=\"strong\">passive voice</span> when we want to give more emphasis to the thing or person that is receiving the action rather than to the agent that is performing it."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Implementing test metric programs is being noted as one of the best ways to assess and improve the performance of an organization. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "If the golden rules for metrics are being used by an organization, it's likely for this one to be taking the improvement of the organization's performance on the right track. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Ensure that the IT and Business groups are being aligned with the metric program as all members of the organization should be coordinated with, and working according to, the principals of this organization.\u201d"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember that we normally use the present continuous when we want to emphasize on the duration of the action or when we want to express that the action is occurring at the precise moment of speaking. <br/><br/>  We can use the <span class=\"strong\">passive voice of present</span> continuous when we want to express that the subject is receiving the action in this precise moment. <br/><br/>  Example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">am being told</span> that the metrics are not working as expected.</span><br/><br/>  We can either express the agent that is performing the action with the preposition <span class=\"strong\">\u2018by'</span> , or, if the context permits it, keep the agent as implicit or unknown (check the example above). <br/><br/>  Example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">I am being told <span class=\"strong\">by the manager</span> that the metrics are not working as expected. </span><br/><br/>  Thus, the structure we use for the passive voice with the present continuous is the following:<br/><br/>  <div class=\"center_text\">Person or thing that receives the action + verb \u2018to be' in present + being + past participle of main verb + complement. </div><br/><br/>  Example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">The metrics <span class=\"strong\">are being evaluated</span>.</span> "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Passive of Present Perfect"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use the <span class=\"strong\">present perfect</span> when we want to either refer to an action that started in the past, but may not have finished yet, or to talk about experiences."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The task of finding meaningful metrics has been underrated by many organizations, as they fail to aim the results of these metrics toward the implementation of actionable steps for continuous improvement. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "As one of my colleagues would say, test metrics are not being focused on the enhancement of the organization if they have not been chosen taking into account what the organization truly wants to achieve and, if their results are not being targeted to carry out a systematic planning for improvement. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Once the data has been analyzed and trended, the organization will use these meaningful insights for planning how to improve.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use the passive of <span class=\"strong\">present perfect</span> when we want to express that an action has occurred and impacted a thing or person. This means that the thing or person could have received the action recently or that it has experienced that action in an unknown moment in the past.  <br/><br/>  Example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">The rules for testing metrics <span class=\"strong\">have already been determined</span>.</span> <br/><br/>  The structure of the <span class=\"strong\">passive of the present perfect</span> is the following:<br/><br/>  <div class=\"center_text\">Thing or person who receives the action (object) + verb \u2018to have' + been + past participle of main verb + complement. </div><br/><br/>  Example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">New testing metrics <span class=\"strong\">have been introduced</span> to the program.</span> <br/><br/>  These are some words you can use with the <span class=\"strong\">present perfect</span>: <br/> <li>Just</li> <li>Already</li> <li>Ever</li> <li>So far</li> <li>Recently</li> <li>Since</li>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "underrate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to value something less than it should be"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Nevertheless, the task of finding meaningful metrics has been underrated by many organizations."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n8le01ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "actionable steps"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a group of processes that can be carried out to achieve or improve something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They fail to aim the results of these metrics toward the implementation of actionable steps for continuous improvement. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n8le01ob11aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "test metrics"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process through which the system, system component, or processes are measured in terms of their performance "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: As one of my colleagues would say, test metrics are not being focused on the enhancement of the organization."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n8le01ob11aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "executive leadership"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person in charge of directing the employees by overseeing and organizing their activities"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These rules state that, first, every metric program must be reviewed by the executive leadership every quarter."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n8le01ob11aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "be on the right track"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go in the right direction."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  However, if the golden rules for metrics are being used by an organization, it's likely for this one to be taking the improvement of the organization's performance on the right track."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n8le01ob11aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "trend"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to show the tendency of something."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: And four, once the data has been analyzed and trended, the organization will use these meaningful insights for planning how to improve.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n8le01ob11aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Take a look to the golden rules described to ensure program testing success"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think about two or three new rules that you consider missing or to complement the ones already stablished."}, {"type": "text", "content": "List them and explain them according to your experience (200 words, use passive of present continuous and passive of present perfect)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your ideas with your partners."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I can think about new rules for test metrics success."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I can list them and explain them according to my experience."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I can share my ideas with my partners."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n8le01ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n8le01ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "Implementing test metric programs is being noted as one of the best ways to assess and improve the performance of an organization. Nevertheless, the task of finding meaningful metrics has been underrated by many organizations, as they fail to aim the results of these metrics toward the implementation of actionable steps for continuous improvement. <br/>\nAs one of my colleagues would say, test metrics are not being focused on the enhancement of the organization if they have not been chosen taking into account what the organization truly wants to achieve, and if their results are not being targeted to carry out a systematic planning for improvement."}, {"time": "37500", "image": "enpe8n8le01ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "However, if the golden rules for metrics are being used by an organization, it's likely for this one to be taking the improvement of the organization's performance on the right track. These rules state that, first, every metric program must be reviewed by the executive leadership every quarter, so that he is up-to-date and aware of the state of the organization. Second, ensure that the IT and Business groups are being aligned with the metric program as all members of the organization should be coordinated with and working according to the principals of this organization. Third, ensure that the data is being collected under uniform standards, otherwise the interpretation of data is going to take more time. And fourth, once the data has been analyzed and trended, the organization will use these meaningful insights for planning how to improve."}, {"time": "86800", "image": "enpe8n8le01ob11re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Even though, applying these four rules is a difficult task to achieve; if they are being followed in the best way possible by an organization, they will significantly improve the usefulness of the metrics' results, and these metrics are going to be providing a more solid base for planning actionable steps for improvement."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n8le01ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about the reasons why some test metric programs fail."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can list some rules of testing metrics management."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss the importance of rules in a testing metrics program."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Why do you think the implementation of metrics can fail sometimes? How should metrics be chosen?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What important parameters do you think need to be taken into account when using metrics?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Metrics can be counterproductive if used inappropriately."}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "img_path": ""}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "STI", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Let's<span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\"> get down to brass tacks</span>! We need to understand what metrics are for "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"typ